    <bpmn:process id="W_W631" name="W631. Strategic Sourcing &amp; Category Strategy" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual category review cycle or new category identification
Frequency: Rolling quarterly (3–4 categories per quarter); annual comprehensive review covers all categories
Volume: ~13 category strategies maintained (one per profile §6.2 category); 3–4 reviewed per quarter
Owner: VP Merchandising
Participants: Category Manager, Senior Buyer, FP&amp;A Analyst, Supply Chain Planner
Source: workflow W631 — Strategic Sourcing &amp; Category Strategy</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W631_LaneSet6">
        <bpmn:lane id="W631_Lane1" name="Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W631_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
