    <bpmn:process id="W_W760" name="W760. Vendor-Specific Commodity Price Index Tracking &amp; Procurement Trigger Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Weekly commodity price index update; or daily price alert for volatile commodities
Frequency: Weekly review; daily monitoring for volatile commodities
Volume: ~50 key commodity SKUs tracked (cement, steel rebar, lumber, copper wire, PVC pipes, plywood)
Owner: Procurement Manager (Strategic Sourcing)
Participants: Procurement Manager, Category Manager, FP&amp;A, CFO (approval for forward buys)
Source: workflow W760 — Vendor-Specific Commodity Price Index Tracking &amp; Procurement Trigger Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W760_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W760_Lane1" name="Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W760_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W760_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W760_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W760_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W760_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W760_Lane3" name="Procurement Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W760_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W760_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W760_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W760_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W760_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W760_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W760_Start5" name="Weekly commodity price index update; or daily price alert for volatile commodities">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W760_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W760_Task6" name="Commodity basket definition — Category Manager defines commodity basket per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Commodity basket definition — Category Manager defines commodity basket per category: primary commodity (e.g., Portland cement), price benchmark (e.g., PH cement wholesale price index), weight in category COGS, and price thresholds for action
Responsible (R): Category Manager
Accountable (A): Procurement Manager
Duration: 8 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W760_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W760_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W760_Task7" name="Price index monitoring — System automatically pulls weekly commodity price…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Price index monitoring — System automatically pulls weekly commodity price indices from configured sources (DTI price monitoring, Philippine Steel Institute, international lumber futures via API); updates price dashboard
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W760_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W760_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W760_Task8" name="Price alert generation — System compares current index against configured…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Price alert generation — System compares current index against configured thresholds: (a) Green (within 5% of 90-day average), (b) Amber (5–15% deviation — review recommended), (c) Red (&gt; 15% deviation — action required)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W760_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W760_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W760_Task9" name="Weekly commodity review — Procurement Manager reviews commodity dashboard; for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Weekly commodity review — Procurement Manager reviews commodity dashboard; for Amber/Red alerts: analyzes trend, driver (supply disruption, seasonal, currency), and forecast direction
Responsible (R): Procurement Manager
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 1 hour/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W760_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W760_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W760_Task10" name="Forward buy decision — If price is trending up and current price is favorable…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Forward buy decision — If price is trending up and current price is favorable: Procurement Manager prepares forward buy proposal: quantity, value, storage capacity check (W584), cash flow impact (W589); presents to CFO for approval
Responsible (R): Procurement Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W760_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W760_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W760_Task11" name="Forward buy execution — If approved: system generates forward purchase order…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Forward buy execution — If approved: system generates forward purchase order (W2C blanket PO or W2B import PO); coordinates with warehouse for storage capacity planning (W652 seasonal surge)
Responsible (R): Procurement Manager
Accountable (A): Warehouse Manager
Duration: Per W2</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W760_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W760_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W760_Task12" name="Price decrease deferral — If price is trending down: Procurement Manager…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Price decrease deferral — If price is trending down: Procurement Manager instructs buyers to purchase minimum quantities only; monitors for further decrease before committing to larger orders
Responsible (R): Procurement Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W760_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W760_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W760_Task13" name="Quarterly strategy review — Quarterly: Procurement Manager presents commodity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Quarterly strategy review — Quarterly: Procurement Manager presents commodity strategy outcomes to leadership: savings achieved, missed opportunities, market outlook, and recommended strategy adjustments
Responsible (R): Procurement Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 4 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W760_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W760_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W760_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W760_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W760_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-246 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor Sourcing &amp; Onboarding (PA-03.1).) | - operational: Procurement Manager (Strategic Sourcing) review and approval gate
Owner: Procurement Manager (Strategic Sourcing)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
