    <bpmn:process id="W_W818" name="W818. Vendor Insurance Certificate &amp; Compliance Documentation Tracking" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New vendor onboarding per W36; annual insurance/certification renewal; compliance audit per W334
Frequency: Ongoing; ~800–1,000 active vendors with insurance/certification requirements
Volume: ~100–150 renewal tracking events per month; ~20–30 new vendor compliance setups
Owner: Procurement Compliance Analyst
Participants: Procurement Analyst, Vendor, Legal Counsel, Finance Manager, Insurance Broker
Source: workflow W818 — Vendor Insurance Certificate &amp; Compliance Documentation Tracking</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W818_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W818_Lane1" name="Procurement Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W818_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W818_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W818_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W818_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W818_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W818_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W818_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W818_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W818_Lane3" name="Vendor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W818_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W818_Lane4" name="Procurement Compliance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W818_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W818_End15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W818_Start6" name="New vendor onboarding per W36; annual insurance/certification renewal; compliance audit…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W818_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W818_Task7" name="At onboarding per W36">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: At onboarding per W36: Procurement Analyst collects required compliance documents per vendor risk tier — Tier 1 (top 20 vendors, 45% COGS): comprehensive insurance + all certifications; Tier 2: general liability insurance + relevant certifications; Tier 3: basic insurance
Responsible (R): Procurement Analyst
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30-60 min/vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W818_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W818_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W818_Task8" name="System creates compliance record per vendor">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System creates compliance record per vendor: document type, coverage amount, expiration date, renewal alert trigger (60/30/7 days)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Procurement Compliance Analyst
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W818_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W818_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W818_Task9" name="System sends automated renewal reminders">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System sends automated renewal reminders to vendor 60 days before expiration via W705 vendor portal
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W818_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W818_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W818_Task10" name="Vendor submits renewed certificate/policy via portal">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Vendor submits renewed certificate/policy via portal; Procurement Analyst verifies: coverage adequacy, BuildRight listed as additional insured, policy limits meet contract requirements per W62
Responsible (R): Vendor / Procurement Analyst
Accountable (A): Procurement Compliance Analyst
Duration: 15-30 min/vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W818_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W818_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W818_Task11" name="If vendor non-responsive at 30-day mark">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: If vendor non-responsive at 30-day mark: Procurement Analyst sends formal notice; system flags vendor account for potential hold
Responsible (R): Procurement Analyst
Accountable (A): Procurement Manager
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W818_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W818_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W818_Task12" name="If certificate expired">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: If certificate expired: system blocks new PO creation for vendor per W2; existing POs continue to completion; Procurement Analyst escalates to Procurement Manager
Responsible (R): System / Procurement Analyst
Accountable (A): Procurement Manager
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W818_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W818_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W818_Task13" name="Annual compliance audit">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Annual compliance audit: Procurement Compliance Analyst reviews all vendor compliance records; generates compliance scorecard per W706; non-compliant vendors flagged for W160 factory audit or termination
Responsible (R): Procurement Compliance Analyst
Accountable (A): Procurement Manager
Duration: 20-30 hours concentrated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W818_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W818_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W818_Task14" name="Insurance claims coordination">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Insurance claims coordination: if vendor-caused incident triggers insurance claim, Procurement Analyst coordinates with W59 insurance lifecycle and Legal per W125
Responsible (R): Procurement Analyst
Accountable (A): Legal Counsel
Duration: Varies</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W818_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W818_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W818_End15" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W818_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W818_Annotation16">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-246 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor Sourcing &amp; Onboarding (PA-03.1).) | - operational: Procurement Compliance Analyst review and approval gate
Owner: Procurement Compliance Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W818_Assoc17" sourceRef="W818_Annotation16" targetRef="W818_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W818_Flow18" sourceRef="W818_Start6" targetRef="W818_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W818_Flow19" sourceRef="W818_Task7" targetRef="W818_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W818_Flow20" sourceRef="W818_Task8" targetRef="W818_Task9" />
