        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-246 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor Sourcing &amp; Onboarding (PA-03.1).) | - operational: Store Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Store Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
