    <bpmn:process id="W_W1157" name="W1157. Vendor Sustainable Packaging Assessment &amp; Plastic Reduction Collaboration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual sustainability review cycle, or ESG reporting preparation (W694), or vendor packaging change proposal, or regulatory packaging requirement update
Frequency: Annual assessment for the top 200 vendors (per W915), with W1157 covering the top 100 in depth; quarterly progress tracking
Volume: Top 100 vendors (representing ~80% of COGS); ~15,000 SKUs assessed
Owner: Category Manager (HQ)
Participants: Category Manager, Sustainability Officer, Vendor Representative, Merchandising Team
Source: workflow W1157 — Vendor Sustainable Packaging Assessment &amp; Plastic Reduction Collaboration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1157_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1157_Lane1" name="Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1157_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1157_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1157_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1157_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1157_Lane2" name="Sustainability Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1157_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1157_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1157_Start4" name="Annual sustainability review cycle, or ESG reporting preparation (W694), or vendor…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1157_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1157_Task5" name="Annual Vendor Packaging Baseline Assessment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Annual Vendor Packaging Baseline Assessment: (a) Category Manager sends packaging data request to top 100 vendors: packaging materials per SKU (cardboard, plastic type, foam, wood), packaging weight as % of product weight, recyclability of packaging materials, current sustainable packaging initiatives; (b) vendor responses collected via vendor portal (W868) or direct submission; (c) sustainability officer scores each vendor on packaging sustainability scorecard: packaging material recyclability (30%), packaging-to-product weight ratio (25%), plastic reduction progress (25%), sustainable material innovation (20%); (d) vendors categorized: A (sustainable leaders), B (improving), C (needs improvement), D (non-compliant)
Responsible (R): Category Manager / Sustainability Officer
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 3–4 weeks (data collection + scoring)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1157_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1157_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1157_Task6" name="Plastic Reduction Target Setting &amp; Collaboration">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Plastic Reduction Target Setting &amp; Collaboration: (a) for Category C and D vendors: Category Manager schedules packaging improvement discussion; (b) present packaging assessment results and BuildRight&#x27;s sustainability targets: 25% reduction in single-use plastic packaging by Year 3, 50% by Year 5; (c) collaborate on alternatives: replace styrofoam with molded pulp or corrugated inserts, replace plastic blister packs with cardboard-backed packaging, replace plastic shrink wrap with paper-based alternatives, reduce excess packaging (right-sizing); (d) agree on timeline and milestones for packaging improvements; (e) for willing vendors: co-invest in packaging redesign (BuildRight may absorb incremental cost up to 1% of COGS for sustainable packaging conversion); (f) updated packaging requirements incorporated into vendor agreement per W62
Responsible (R): Category Manager / Vendor Representative
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 1–2 hours per vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1157_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1157_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1157_Task7" name="Quarterly Progress Tracking &amp; Verification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Quarterly Progress Tracking &amp; Verification: (a) vendors submit quarterly packaging progress report: SKUs transitioned to sustainable packaging, plastic weight reduced, new packaging materials introduced; (b) sustainability officer verifies progress through: sample inspection at DC receiving (W3), vendor-provided packaging certification, and photographic evidence; (c) progress tracked against agreed milestones; (d) vendors on track: recognized in quarterly vendor scorecard (W44) sustainability metric; (e) vendors behind schedule: escalated for corrective action plan; (f) progress data feeds into ESG report (W694) and RA 11898 EPR compliance report
Responsible (R): Sustainability Officer / Category Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 2–3 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1157_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1157_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1157_Task8" name="Annual Packaging Sustainability Award &amp; Vendor Incentive">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Annual Packaging Sustainability Award &amp; Vendor Incentive: (a) annual vendor packaging sustainability awards: top 3 vendors in each category receive recognition at vendor summit; (b) award winners receive preferential terms: extended payment terms, increased shelf space allocation, priority in new product evaluations; (c) vendor packaging innovation showcase: winners&#x27; sustainable packaging solutions shared with all vendors as best practices; (d) annual packaging sustainability report published in ESG section of BuildRight website
Responsible (R): Category Manager / Sustainability Officer
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 1–2 days/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1157_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1157_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1157_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1157_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1157_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-246 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor Sourcing &amp; Onboarding (PA-03.1).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: Category Manager (HQ)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1157_Assoc11" sourceRef="W1157_Annotation10" targetRef="W1157_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
