    <bpmn:process id="W_W1546" name="W1546. Vendor Factory Social Compliance Audit Scheduling, Scoring &amp; Corrective Action Tracking" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual audit calendar cycle; or vendor onboarded for private label / direct import; or substantiated labor/rights complaint
Frequency: ~30–40 factory audits/year (top 20 vendors + risk-based sampling of 10–20 others)
Volume: Particularly relevant for import vendors (China, Taiwan, Indonesia)
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Participants: Regulatory Officer, Category Manager, Buyer, third-party audit firm, vendor factory management
Source: workflow W1546 — Vendor Factory Social Compliance Audit Scheduling, Scoring &amp; Corrective Action Tracking</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1546_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1546_Lane1" name="Regulatory Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1546_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1546_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1546_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1546_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1546_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1546_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1546_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1546_Lane2" name="Audit Firm">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1546_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1546_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1546_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1546_Start4" name="Annual audit calendar cycle; or vendor onboarded for private label / direct import; or…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1546_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1546_Task5" name="Annual audit plan">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Annual audit plan: Regulatory Officer develops risk-based audit plan — top 20 vendors by spend (mandatory annual audit), new vendors (audit within 6 months of first shipment), vendors in high-risk countries or categories, random sample of 10–20 additional vendors; schedule shared with Category Managers to coordinate with buying calendar
Responsible (R): Regulatory Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: 4 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1546_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1546_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1546_Task6" name="Audit scheduling &amp; coordination">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Audit scheduling &amp; coordination: Regulatory Officer engages accredited third-party audit firm; coordinates audit date with vendor factory; shares BuildRight code of conduct and audit checklist (labor rights, working hours, wages, safety, child labor, environmental compliance); buyer notifies vendor of upcoming audit
Responsible (R): Regulatory Officer / Buyer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 hours/audit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1546_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1546_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1546_Task7" name="On-site audit execution">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: On-site audit execution: Third-party audit firm conducts on-site factory audit — document review (payroll, time records, employment contracts), worker interviews, facility walkthrough, safety equipment verification, dormitory/canteen inspection (if applicable); audit report submitted within 10 business days
Responsible (R): Audit Firm
Accountable (A): Regulatory Officer
Duration: 1–2 days on-site</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1546_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1546_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1546_Task8" name="Scoring &amp; classification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Scoring &amp; classification: Regulatory Officer reviews audit report; scores vendor against BuildRight compliance scorecard (100-point scale); classifies: Green (≥ 85, compliant), Amber (70–84, minor findings), Red (&lt; 70, critical findings — immediate corrective action required)
Responsible (R): Regulatory Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: 1 hour/audit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1546_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1546_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1546_Task9" name="Corrective action plan (CAP)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Corrective action plan (CAP): For Amber/Red findings, Regulatory Officer issues CAP with specific findings, required remediation actions, and deadline (Amber: 60 days, Red: 30 days for critical items); vendor acknowledges and submits remediation plan; buyer monitors commercial relationship impact
Responsible (R): Regulatory Officer
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 2 hours/CAP</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1546_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1546_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1546_Task10" name="CAP follow-up verification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: CAP follow-up verification: For Red findings, third-party audit firm conducts follow-up verification audit within 30 days of CAP deadline; for Amber findings, desk review with photo evidence; system tracks CAP status (Open, In Progress, Verified, Overdue)
Responsible (R): Audit Firm / Regulatory Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: 1 hour/vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1546_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1546_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1546_Task11" name="Vendor scorecard integration">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Vendor scorecard integration: Audit score feeds into vendor performance scorecard (W44, W706); persistent Red ratings trigger vendor review committee — potential volume reduction or vendor termination per contract terms
Responsible (R): Regulatory Officer
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 30 min/vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1546_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1546_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1546_Task12" name="Annual compliance report">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Annual compliance report: Regulatory Officer compiles annual social compliance report — total audits conducted, compliance rate trend, CAP closure rate, vendor termination actions; report feeds into ESG reporting (W694) and annual sustainability report (W114)
Responsible (R): Regulatory Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: 4 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1546_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1546_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1546_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1546_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1546_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-246 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor Sourcing &amp; Onboarding (PA-03.1).) | - operational: VP Legal &amp; Compliance review and approval gate
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1546_Assoc15" sourceRef="W1546_Annotation14" targetRef="W1546_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1546_Flow16" sourceRef="W1546_Start4" targetRef="W1546_Task5" />
